---
import { completedProjects, ongoingProjects } from '../../data/projects';
import { socialLinks } from '../../data/social-links';
const totalProjects = completedProjects.length + ongoingProjects.length;
---

<section id="about" class="profile-section relative z-10 px-6 py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <div class="profile-heading">
      <p class="profile-eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE SYSTEMS</p>
      <h2>One mind. Many disciplines.<br/><span>One direction: impact.</span></h2>
      <p>I’m not defined by a list of tools. I’m defined by how I connect data, business context, engineering, and people to solve the problem that actually matters.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="profile-banner" aria-label="Professional philosophy">
      <div class="profile-banner-mark">ॐ</div>
      <div class="profile-banner-copy">
        <p class="profile-banner-sanskrit">तत्त्वमसि · यद् भावं तद् भवति · यथा दृष्टिः तथा सृष्टिः</p>
        <p class="profile-banner-english">What I think, I will become. <span>·</span> What I envision, I will create. <span>·</span> What I build, I will scale.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="profile-grid mt-14">
      <article class="profile-card profile-identity">
        <div class="profile-photo-wrap"><img src="/images/profile.jpg" alt="Vinod M, data analytics and AI practitioner based in Mysuru" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div>
        <p class="profile-name">Vinod M</p>
        <p class="profile-role">AI & Data Problem Solver · Business Systems Builder</p>
        <p class="profile-card-summary">I connect business problems to data, design, automation and software—then make the solution usable.</p>
        <div class="profile-tags"><span>GRS Fantasy Park · MIS & Business Systems</span><span>Medhaksha Technologies · Founding Team</span><span>MCA · Computer Science · Mysuru, India</span></div>
        <div class="profile-links">
          <a href={socialLinks.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
          <a href={socialLinks.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <div class="profile-story">
        <p class="profile-kicker">MY PROFESSIONAL STORY</p>
        <h3>Think like an analyst.<br/>Build like an engineer.<br/><em>Deliver like an owner.</em></h3>
        <p>My strength is moving between layers: understanding what a team or business needs, examining the data and process behind it, designing the workflow, and building the reporting or software that makes it work in practice. I enjoy the whole problem—not just the tool used to solve it.</p>
        <p>At GRS Fantasy Park, my work focuses on MIS and business systems, process engineering, FMS and checklist monitoring, workflow automation, operational reporting, and internal application development. I aim to turn disconnected steps into clear ownership, useful controls, reliable data and management visibility.</p>
        <p>Through Medhaksha Technologies, I contribute to data, AI and business-intelligence solutions—from dashboards and automation to applied AI prototypes. My project work also spans computer vision, NLP, document intelligence, data pipelines and deployed web products. Across all of it, the standard is the same: solve a real problem, validate the result, and make it maintainable.</p>
        <div class="profile-pillars">
          <div><span>01 / DISCOVER</span><strong>Understand</strong><p>Map the business problem, the people involved, the data, and the constraints before reaching for a tool.</p></div>
          <div><span>02 / ENGINEER</span><strong>Build</strong><p>Turn requirements into clear workflows, validated data, useful interfaces, automation and decision-ready reporting.</p></div>
          <div><span>03 / SCALE</span><strong>Improve</strong><p>Measure what changed, close gaps, reduce manual effort and leave a system others can depend on.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="profile-proof-strip">
          <div><strong>{totalProjects}+</strong><span>Projects & prototypes</span></div>
          <div><strong>1</strong><span>Research publication</span></div>
          <div><strong>SQL · Python · BI</strong><span>Core delivery toolkit</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="profile-next-step"><span class="profile-next-dot"></span><p><strong>Open to meaningful work</strong><br/>Data analytics, MIS, business intelligence, automation, and applied AI opportunities.</p><a href="/#contact" aria-label="Contact Vinod M">Let’s talk ↗</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .profile-section{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#080d12 0%,#091117 100%);color:#f2f0e7}
  .profile-heading{max-width:900px}.profile-eyebrow,.profile-kicker{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.24em;color:#ceb678;font-weight:700}.profile-heading h2{margin-top:18px;font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5.2vw,4.8rem);font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1.02}.profile-heading h2 span{color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(105deg,#f2dda7,#c4a258 55%,#78d1d6);background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text}.profile-heading>p:last-child{margin-top:22px;color:#aab6b7;max-width:760px;font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.8}
  .profile-banner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:23px;max-width:980px;margin-top:32px;padding:20px 24px;border:1px solid #d4b56938;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 0% 50%,#d8b96b10,transparent 60%),linear-gradient(100deg,#101c22,#0a1016);box-shadow:0 15px 55px #0003}.profile-banner-mark{flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #d8b96b66;color:#eed89e;font:2rem Georgia,serif;box-shadow:0 0 32px #d8b96b18}.profile-banner-copy{min-width:0}.profile-banner-sanskrit{font:1rem/1.8 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:.025em;color:#e5cd8d}.profile-banner-english{margin-top:5px;color:#aab9b8;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.8}.profile-banner-english span{color:#64cbd2;margin:0 3px}
  .profile-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,.72fr) minmax(0,1.5fr);gap:clamp(28px,6vw,84px);align-items:start}
  .profile-card{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #d8c58a2c;background:linear-gradient(155deg,#122027,#0b1116 75%);padding:32px;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 25px 90px #0005}.profile-card:before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d7b96b,#6acbd1,transparent)}
  .profile-photo-wrap{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/4.7;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,#24414a,#0b1116 72%);border:1px solid #ffffff20}.profile-photo-wrap img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 25%;filter:saturate(.86);transition:transform .7s}.profile-card:hover .profile-photo-wrap img{transform:scale(1.035)}
  .profile-card-summary{margin-top:14px;color:#b5c3c1;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.75}.profile-name{font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin-top:23px}.profile-role{margin-top:5px;color:#9db4b5;font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6}.profile-tags{display:grid;gap:9px;margin-top:22px}.profile-tags span{font-size:.76rem;color:#d3d2c8;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #ffffff19;background:#ffffff05}.profile-links{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:26px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #ffffff1a}.profile-links a{font-size:.8rem;color:#dec988}.profile-links a:hover{color:#fff}
  .profile-story{padding-top:5px}.profile-story h3{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem);line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.05em;font-weight:600;margin-top:17px}.profile-story h3 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;color:#d8b96e}.profile-story>p:not(.profile-kicker){font-size:1rem;line-height:1.85;color:#aebabb;max-width:760px;margin-top:20px}
  .profile-pillars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:32px}.profile-pillars>div{padding:18px 15px;border-top:1px solid #d5b96d70;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff08,transparent)}.profile-pillars span{display:block;font-size:.61rem;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#6bcbd1}.profile-pillars strong{display:block;font-size:1rem;margin-top:14px;color:#f0e5c4}.profile-pillars p{font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.65;color:#8fa1a3;margin-top:8px}
  .profile-proof-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1.5fr;gap:18px;margin-top:34px;padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #ffffff1c;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff1c}.profile-proof-strip div{display:grid;gap:7px}.profile-proof-strip strong{font-size:1.35rem;color:#e5cd8f}.profile-proof-strip span{font-size:.73rem;color:#94a5a6;line-height:1.5}
  .profile-next-step{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-top:28px;padding:17px 18px;border:1px solid #8ccfd12d;background:#10212680}.profile-next-dot{flex:none;width:8px;height:8px;background:#8fdcb8;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 14px #8fdcb8}.profile-next-step p{font-size:.82rem;line-height:1.65;color:#9fb1b2;flex:1}.profile-next-step p strong{color:#eee5cb}.profile-next-step>a{white-space:nowrap;font-size:.8rem;color:#e2c77e}
  @media(max-width:800px){.profile-banner{align-items:flex-start;padding:17px;gap:14px}.profile-banner-mark{width:48px;height:48px;font-size:1.6rem}.profile-banner-sanskrit{font-size:.86rem}.profile-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.profile-card{max-width:470px;width:100%;margin:0 auto}.profile-photo-wrap{max-height:480px}.profile-story{padding-top:16px}}
  @media(max-width:520px){.profile-banner{padding:14px;gap:12px}.profile-banner-mark{width:40px;height:40px;font-size:1.35rem}.profile-banner-english{font-size:.82rem}.profile-banner-sanskrit{font-size:.78rem}.profile-section{padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}.profile-card{padding:22px}.profile-pillars{grid-template-columns:1fr}.profile-pillars>div{padding:15px}.profile-pillars strong{margin-top:7px}.profile-proof-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.profile-proof-strip div:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}.profile-next-step{align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap}.profile-next-step>a{margin-left:22px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.profile-photo-wrap img{transition:none}}
</style>
